{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10130100","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10130100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1013010001:1":{"text":"失礼した。改めてあなた方の助太刀に感謝する。","source_cn":"失礼了，请允许我再次感谢诸位的鼎力协助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DCE254BE07B008C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013010002:2":{"text":"できることをやったまでさ。むしろ<style=\"highlight\">聖堂騎士</style>の皆さま方こそが真の英雄だよ！","source_cn":"我们只是尽力而为，真正的英雄是你们——大驾光临的圣堂骑士们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79F5DEC7C9FB180C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1013010002":{"text":"できることをやったまでさ。むしろ<style=\"highlight\">聖堂騎士</style>の皆さま方こそが真の英雄だよ！","source_cn":"我们只是尽力而为，真正的英雄是你们——大驾光临的圣堂骑士们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79F5DEC7C9FB180C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013010003:2":{"text":"俺も言ってみたくなったんだよ。","source_cn":"只是想说说看嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FE6254063282267","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013010005:1":{"text":"私は聖堂に所属する聖騎士だ。こたびは小隊を率いて偶然聖石町を通りかかってな……","source_cn":"艾雅在上，我是隶属圣堂的圣骑士，目前带领一个小队途径圣石镇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA644C8D4048F995E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013010006:1":{"text":"私は副隊長のルシウスと申します。我々が聖石町に到着して間もないうちに魔像が現れたのです。","source_cn":"我是副队卢修斯，我们抵达圣石镇不久，恰好碰上魔偶来袭……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FF18FE2C6B6B6C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1013010007:1":{"text":"今や「魔像」と呼ばれているあのモンスターは……","source_cn":"请允许我告知各位，如今被称为“魔偶”的怪物——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x576470A5CBDC82F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013010008:1":{"text":"女神様や聖堂と関係があるのだ。だから彼らの凶行を阻止するのも我々の責務なのだよ。","source_cn":"与女神和圣堂有关，阻止它们为祸人间，也是我们的责任所在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C741990EB4FB282","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1013010009:1":{"text":"「善意の道は、深淵へと続く」か、おたくの女神様は慈愛の加減ってものを知らないのか？","source_cn":"“善意之路，通往深渊。”你们的女神，当初就不能少慈爱一点吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5AE17E7B36B549E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1013010010:2":{"text":"……あなたの信心が浅くとも、私にはなんの支障もない。","source_cn":"……你不够虔信，这并不是我的损失。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x931EAC984EA78ECB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"どこかで聞いた台詞だな……","source_cn":"真是耳熟……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x23C599EE6228B7B4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"どこかで聞いた台詞だな……","female":"どこかで聞いた台詞ね……","variant_male_record_index":"62166","variant_female_record_index":"62167","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1013010004:1":{"text":"鎧を着ていると辞儀もしづらくてな。我々の態度が何か誤解を招いたのなら、誠に申し訳ない。","source_cn":"重甲在身，不便行礼。如果我们的态度引起误会……我道歉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E76170F484CEB35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"皮肉が効いてるな。","source_cn":"真是刺耳","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB372182A5D1033BA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"皮肉が効いてるな。","female":"皮肉が効いてるわね。","variant_male_record_index":"62168","variant_female_record_index":"62169","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"テミシア","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"ヴァレン","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢修斯":{"text":"ルシウス","source":"卢修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":3}}